$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Air";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Cestus" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Hazy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have both dropped compact bases opposite of each other. This once proud Quad Temple now lays to waste. However, the Quad Temple, set high above the surface, poses the only way to get to the enemy's flag. The first Tribe to reach six(6) captures wins. May the best Tribe prove victorious!!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> Lisa W. (LadyShar).... Find all my maps at http://welcome.to/LadyShars";